msgstr "静默"

msgid "Info"
msgstr "信息"

msgid "All (Debug)"
msgstr "全部（调试）"

msgid "Silent: no logs. Info: only key events (default, less log). All: include debug messages. The log is cleared automatically every 3 days."
msgstr "静默：不记录日志。信息：仅记录关键事件（默认，日志少）。全部：包含调试信息。日志每 3 天自动清理一次。"
